In the context of this discussion it sure matters.  The Corporate Machine
doesn't compare to Master of Orion either.

If you're making a sequel to an existing franchise then you need to respect
the world/game mechanics of the franchise.

We are going to do a fantasy based strategy after we finish Galactic
Civilizations II.  What it will be called remains to be seen of course.  But
if it becomes Master of Magic II it will certainly be designed as a sequel
and not some sort of new game that happens to have the same name.

